DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nHalloween falls on a Saturday ev
 ery 6.9 years. Let's celebrate this moderately rare occasion by haunting d
 owntown.\n\nWe'll meet at Visuals Rooftop Bar above Eulogy around 7\, and 
 see where the spirits take us.\n\nCome in costume... or don't. Just be the
 re\, be responsible\, and have fun
